                "en": "Role Secretary: your choice for this role, else the preset — the field “Background analysis model” (semantic_model) from your settings. A role choice saved for this conversation only is not taken into account today. So the preset of this role points at the same field as Background analysis, not “Secretary model” (guardian_model) — that one is step 1."
