                "en": "Role Background analysis: your choice for this role, else the preset — the field “Background analysis model” (semantic_model) from your settings, the same as step 1. A role choice saved for this conversation only is not taken into account today. This step only matters when you choose a model for this role. The batch analysis, however, takes the field “Background analysis model” directly — a choice for the role does not reach it: with only the role chosen and the field empty, single messages are read by the role’s model, while a batch would go out without a model name."
